      "One line came up short":"有 1 行少送了",
      "You were only charged for what turned up, so there's nothing to refund here. Check their monthly statement bills it the same way.":"你只按實到的數量付了錢，所以這裏沒有要退的。記得覈對他們月結單上也是按實到算的。",
      "Claim updated":"追討進度已更新",
      // ---- Monthly statement reconciliation ----
      "Which month":"對哪個月", "📋 Check their statement":"📋 對賬單",
      "Tick every docket that appears on their statement. Leave the ones they haven't billed yet.":"他們賬單上有哪幾張，就勾哪幾張。他們還沒開賬的，別勾。",
