      "the one total on their paperwork":"他們那張紙上的那個總數",
      "Your dockets, ticked":"你勾選的小票合計",
      "Type their total above and the gap appears here.":"在上面填他們的總額，差多少就會顯示在這裏。",
      "Matches to the cent.":"分毫不差。",
      "Nothing to chase — this month is clean.":"沒有要追的 —— 這個月是乾淨的。",
      "of your dockets isn't on their statement":"的小票沒出現在他們賬單上",
      "Not an error — they usually catch up next month. Worth knowing so you don't pay it twice when they do.":"不是錯 —— 他們通常下個月補上。知道這件事，是爲了下個月別付第二遍。",
