      "on your dockets that their statement is under":"你的小票比他們賬單多出來的",
      "Ring them before this gets paid. Usually a delivery nobody wrote down, or a docket billed at a different price than the one on the paper.":"付款之前先打電話。多半是有一次送貨沒人記下來，或者同一張小票他們按別的價格開的賬。",
