      "What it cost you":"這些倒掉的錢",
      "📅 Out of date":"📅 過期了", "🥀 Spoiled or off":"🥀 壞了 / 變味",
      "🔥 Prep error / burnt":"🔥 做壞了 / 燒糊了", "💥 Dropped or damaged":"💥 摔了 / 弄壞了",
      "↩️ Sent back by a customer":"↩️ 客人退回來的", "🗑 Other":"🗑 其他",
      "Write down what went in the bin and why. This takes it off your stock straight away, and it's the only way the forecast can tell what you cooked from what you threw away.":"把倒掉的東西和原因記下來。記完庫存立刻扣減 —— 這也是預測能分清「做掉的」和「倒掉的」的唯一辦法。",
      "Nothing recorded":"沒記錄任何東西",
      "e.g. fridge door left open overnight":"例如：冰箱門昨晚沒關嚴",
      "That's stock you paid for and sold none of. It's inside the usage figures below, not on top of them.":"這些是你花錢買了、但一分錢沒賣出去的貨。它已經算在下面的用量裏了，不是額外再加一筆。",
      "went in the bin rather than into a dish. The daily rate above deliberately still counts it — you have to buy it either way.":"是倒掉的，不是做成菜的。上面的每日用量特意仍然把它算進去 —— 反正這些你都得照買。",
      "went in the bin in the last 30 days":"在最近 30 天倒進了垃圾桶",
      "This may already be waiting at the back door":"這批貨可能已經在後門等着點收了",
      "Checking it in there files the docket and moves the stock. Typing it up here as well counts the same goods twice.":"在那邊點收就已經把小票歸檔、庫存也進了。這裏再錄一遍，同一批貨會被算兩次。",
      "Check it in instead →":"改去點收 →",
      "🧾 See the docket":"🧾 看這張小票",
      "Filed as a docket":"已存爲小票",
      "Signing here files the docket as well: received quantities go into stock at the prices above, and the whole thing lands in Purchases. You never type it twice.":"在這裏簽字等於同時把小票歸檔：實收數量按上面的價格進庫存，整張單子進採購頁。不用錄第二遍。",
      "Confirming a delivery is the whole job in one go: received quantities go into stock, the prices you were charged are recorded, and the docket files itself into Purchases. Short and damaged lines are flagged for you to chase.":"點收一次把事辦完：實收數量進庫存、被收的價格記下來、小票自動歸檔到採購頁。少送或破損的行會標出來給你去追。",
      "Signed · stock updated and the docket is filed":"已簽收 · 庫存已更新，小票已歸檔",
