      "Deliveries are switched off":"送貨功能已關閉",
      "Two ways out of here. Expect it at the back door when you\'ve just placed the order — whoever takes the delivery counts it off the truck, and the docket files itself. Already arrived is for stock that\'s standing in front of you right now.":"兩條路。剛下完單就選“等着後門點收”—— 送到時誰收貨誰當場點，小票自動歸檔。“貨已經到了”是給已經擺在你面前的貨用的。",
      "This adds these quantities to your stock and logs the spend against each supplier. Only do it once the delivery is actually in.":"這會把這些數量加進庫存，並按供應商各記一筆支出。等貨真的到了再點。",
      "came up short":"少送了", "damaged":"破損", "wrong item":"發錯貨",
